From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Eriko Kurimoto <elkurin@google.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 01:32:50 -0700
Subject: [M152] Plumb CacheStorageSideDataWriter capability remote for code
 cache

Original change's description:
> Plumb CacheStorageSideDataWriter capability remote for code cache
>
> Currently, URLResponseHead and FetchAPIResponse pass cache names as
> strings for CacheStorage code-cache metadata feedback. This introduces a
> TOCTOU risk and loses storage bucket identity when writing side data.
>
> This change replaces string cache/bucket names with a
> pending_remote<network.mojom.CacheStorageSideDataWriter> bound directly
> to the CacheStorageCache entry that served the response, invoked
> directly by the renderer.
>
